{"id": "official:sentence:0547df10-6d4f-4cef-a407-082ba713599b", "text": "我听见隔壁房间有人说话。", "shortMeaning": "我听见隔壁有人说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5dcc4bce-6687-4f1b-b09c-714b9fcb145a", "text": "我听说了你有美丽的口音。", "shortMeaning": "我听说你的口音很好听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd1770d6-22f1-4691-acb2-a5a4540f3a59", "text": "我听说他打麻将很厉害。", "shortMeaning": "听说他麻将打得很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:658683a6-7ef4-417c-a5e3-01169a8387de", "text": "我听说你们结婚了？", "shortMeaning": "听说你们结婚了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8809b5ea-d448-4ce2-a26a-b2653738957a", "text": "我听说你是位艺术家。", "shortMeaning": "听说你是艺术家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7be474c-a229-48d0-9f70-a8218662e1a1", "text": "我听说英国的草在冬天也还是绿的。", "shortMeaning": "听说英国的草冬天也还是绿的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b51b392e-da90-4ee4-8765-4d49d3fd6540", "text": "我听说过那个故事。", "shortMeaning": "我听过那个故事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73306e1a-1cf4-4836-9687-46475f46d1af", "text": "我听说，你想来见我了吗？", "shortMeaning": "听说你想来见我了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:daa38ad0-a015-458b-82bd-584bf242b195", "text": "我听说，她下个月结婚了。", "shortMeaning": "听说她下个月结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a68d4f68-469b-4d51-abba-def1442e558c", "text": "我听过她的很多歌，所以我认识她。", "shortMeaning": "我听过她很多歌，所以认识她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8419827b-f120-4f32-b983-238e3859ea71", "text": "我听过这首歌的法语版。", "shortMeaning": "这首歌的法语版我听过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:104ecda6-323f-4a27-8abb-dc47a8d699f1", "text": "我告诉了他我想去波士顿。", "shortMeaning": "我跟他说我想去波士顿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:846b2f89-bdac-492f-879d-8a29d1f4e5d7", "text": "我告诉了他问题所在。", "shortMeaning": "我向他说明了问题所在。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07778439-219b-421d-9b38-beb2cace5a27", "text": "我告诉他们你饿了。", "shortMeaning": "我跟他们说你饿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84a76e48-9244-4d33-9504-fc3c360b2a6e", "text": "我告诉你，你也不会信。", "shortMeaning": "就算告诉你，你也不信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a3cad64-e52b-4489-a052-9af4b15111f6", "text": "我告诉过他不要用那些。", "shortMeaning": "我告诉过他别用那些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3096f493-6b88-4963-8e8b-4c3233352db8", "text": "我告诉过你不要再来这里了。", "shortMeaning": "我告诉过你别再来这里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:581a1dc1-1e4c-47cc-b8bc-e219e211440c", "text": "我周日从来都不在家。", "shortMeaning": "我周日从来不在家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58d58f4d-d8e4-45a0-90d6-8d8a405f6751", "text": "我和他们意见一致。", "shortMeaning": "我和他们看法相同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c4f1c54-6404-4212-a792-2d28bbf65e41", "text": "我和他约了7点钟见面。", "shortMeaning": "我和他约了七点见面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24419915-650a-4cde-af23-9ce30ff7618b", "text": "我和他谈得很愉快。", "shortMeaning": "我和他聊得很开心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b0bce00-4588-4404-a1ed-4521896ca4f9", "text": "我和他达成了交易。", "shortMeaning": "我和他做成了交易。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a641b9ee-5ad8-4b7e-a2d2-2cacbee95daa", "text": "我和别人的看法毫不相同；很久以来，人们就指摘我这一点。", "shortMeaning": "我与别人看法完全不同，长久以来人们总为此指责我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8dcc9fb-28ce-48f7-9ac7-c139bd21fb5a", "text": "我和她在中学是一个班的。", "shortMeaning": "我和她中学时同班。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12786ca8-e52a-4bbf-99ba-7c899d4336f8", "text": "我和她外出了几个月。", "shortMeaning": "我和她交往了几个月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ca76de6-0e04-4bfe-89a8-801bd07b1fd0", "text": "我和她聊得很愉快。", "shortMeaning": "我和她聊得很开心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6fda580a-c3bd-43de-b6c8-6aa7423b296f", "text": "我和平常一样起得早。", "shortMeaning": "我像平时一样早起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b99c900-d747-4bb7-a72e-74bb37aaf8a0", "text": "我和往常一样起得很早。", "shortMeaning": "我像往常一样起得很早。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dac62fed-5afc-4fac-950f-2d89ea145ff9", "text": "我和您想得完全一样。", "shortMeaning": "我的想法和您完全一致。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88ea7b1d-c340-4335-9b7a-8b541e1c3a90", "text": "我和我的丈夫都是老师。", "shortMeaning": "我和丈夫都是老师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efee6a2d-5bfb-4b62-a247-52ec90eb3ec3", "text": "我和我的邻居关系很好。", "shortMeaning": "我和邻居关系很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc896152-8d14-4bfb-adb0-3196831a42e4", "text": "我和所有人都说过话。", "shortMeaning": "我和每个人都说过话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d420e684-af74-4535-842a-11bf17b840d3", "text": "我和波兰大使说了话。", "shortMeaning": "我和波兰大使谈了话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cda3ee6-499c-422e-9779-6cbf3fe995a9", "text": "我和洋子有了一点争执。", "shortMeaning": "我和洋子起了点争执。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e06802e6-db53-47a4-9de6-54873274c6c1", "text": "我和男友第一次约会就发生了性关系。", "shortMeaning": "我和男友第一次约会就发生了关系。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:535b0abc-fd6a-4aa9-b113-7033dd27b0de", "text": "我和疯子唯一的区别是我不是疯子。", "shortMeaning": "我和疯子的唯一区别是我没疯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64b02cd3-9554-4401-a855-d2d009a10945", "text": "我和老干妈有爱恨交加的关系。", "shortMeaning": "我和老干妈爱恨交加。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ca942b2-c350-4dfc-9081-71b9f5fa86a7", "text": "我咳嗽停不下来了。", "shortMeaning": "我咳嗽停不下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8adbbf0d-b189-4171-b83d-008c5199633c", "text": "我哥住在一座小村庄里。", "shortMeaning": "我哥住在一个小村庄。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ce22bc6-62ce-4024-b32b-57f187cff271", "text": "我哥哥以前在纽约生活。", "shortMeaning": "我哥以前住在纽约。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c06bfc1-4db5-4b3f-856c-99622eb40f6b", "text": "我哥哥假装工作很努力。", "shortMeaning": "我哥哥假装很努力工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5624d748-eda1-45d0-87ee-90141b6345be", "text": "我哥在车祸中受伤了。", "shortMeaning": "我哥哥在车祸中受了伤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3403f8c-088b-40ee-9045-91d4e0206f09", "text": "我哥有一辆红汽车。", "shortMeaning": "我哥有一辆红色汽车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af2ef345-747d-4b86-bbf3-183e5021cbe2", "text": "我哪里说过那样的话？", "shortMeaning": "我什么时候说过那种话？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ce10229-288f-4074-acc7-ed0d1be6f626", "text": "我啊，坐过火箭去太空哦。", "shortMeaning": "我坐过火箭去太空哦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:645398e3-e061-4cc9-9e75-e946e0dff7aa", "text": "我喜欢做自己的老板。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢自己做老板。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:627f23be-d13d-446b-a844-128e97c18f44", "text": "我喜欢和你一起吃早餐。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢与你共进早餐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0544c314-1a95-4077-a746-05bd39dfd681", "text": "我喜欢和朋友一起讨论好吃的。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢和朋友一起聊美食。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d0e6e28-bd41-4c60-9a74-12d8be27ad3c", "text": "我喜欢喝咖啡不加糖。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢喝不加糖的咖啡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06258cf0-83e5-4db1-a341-96f9b48cd133", "text": "我喜欢圣诞蛋糕上有草莓。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢圣诞蛋糕带草莓。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ea4436f5-6dce-441e-b96b-c9e410837c7e", "text": "我喜欢在大自然中散步。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢在大自然里散步。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37966983-1fd3-4f7d-be40-f991b78ac52a", "text": "我喜欢在每晚睡觉前洗个热水澡。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢每晚睡前洗个热水澡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7000f220-6c0a-4de5-8d16-aa763df4643d", "text": "我喜欢在纽约第五大街购物。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢去纽约第五大街购物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f1b31fd-c8b1-416a-8938-c360562b656c", "text": "我喜欢妈妈多一些。", "shortMeaning": "我更喜欢妈妈一些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a41cf149-2044-42c6-b881-15b2673d239f", "text": "我喜欢学习各种各样的语言。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢学各种语言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:914b8d55-0de7-4bd0-a630-ead27035784f", "text": "我喜欢孩子。这就是为什么我成为了教师。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢孩子，所以成了教师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:99b655c7-a6af-4dc1-a307-7a26865f6723", "text": "我喜欢狗，我妹妹喜欢猫。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢狗，妹妹喜欢猫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f3218b2-85a3-4eac-be2b-cc2c7fe60d45", "text": "我喜欢独自一人散步。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢独自散步。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c06044a-062a-4728-be8d-70fb8900b442", "text": "我喜欢这个工作因为它立竿见影，让人很有成就感。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢这工作，因为立竿见影又有成就感。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa84b291-5886-4445-bb90-e14a324680c2", "text": "我喝水因为我渴了。", "shortMeaning": "我渴了才喝水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ced13d5b-6adf-4304-96fa-67b5ae958ffe", "text": "我喝醉了，但是还会说德语。", "shortMeaning": "我喝醉了，但还会说德语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba7851f4-85d8-49a1-abcc-33e1ce138a7b", "text": "我回到家的时候，感觉非常饿。", "shortMeaning": "我回到家时感觉很饿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a27d416d-f057-48c9-bf82-e95084ef8da5", "text": "我回去很遥远的地方，不要问我那里。", "shortMeaning": "我要回很远的地方，别问是哪里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26ed9299-60d1-4c24-9433-fec25854baa5", "text": "我回来了！啊？我们有客人啊？", "shortMeaning": "我回来了！啊？我们有客人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e104f942-500c-483f-94bd-1062b306f6f8", "text": "我回来了！啊？有人来看我们吗？", "shortMeaning": "我回来了！咦？有客人来吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf0a4370-4834-47e3-b4a4-9dee16e121f5", "text": "我回答了你的问题吗？", "shortMeaning": "我回答你的问题了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9efde5ea-f8e6-490d-b9b0-2ee8faf52add", "text": "我回答您之前要好好考虑一下。", "shortMeaning": "回答您之前我要好好想想。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1497fd52-fb99-4f2a-bf5e-4e7f2e7a7722", "text": "我因为化妆品皮肤过敏了。", "shortMeaning": "我用化妆品皮肤过敏了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd54b6ab-382c-4e97-826f-9dbed36a78af", "text": "我因为想知道她是否来了看了窗外一眼。", "shortMeaning": "我想看她是否来了，就朝窗外看了一眼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:293ebced-098d-40f5-9222-984ce8c60ca4", "text": "我因为没有参加他的葬礼而感到很糟糕。", "shortMeaning": "我因没参加他的葬礼而很难受。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee441604-9b80-42e9-a2cb-569cd7f8b83c", "text": "我国全面建成小康社会取得伟大历史性成就。", "shortMeaning": "我国全面建成小康社会取得历史性成就。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edc6b64e-c1c4-4bb5-b717-c47ba67acae0", "text": "我国大城市存在很严重的污染问题。", "shortMeaning": "我国大城市污染很严重。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9bbe1288-6a95-4433-a0aa-57a329889e19", "text": "我国是一个人口众多，物产丰富的国家。", "shortMeaning": "我国人口众多、物产丰富。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:396da263-43f7-4a75-91d4-01f4b42686b7", "text": "我在2003年的时候是13岁。", "shortMeaning": "2003年时我十三岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:859fcd1e-f29d-4bf2-9571-95aa5ce021ed", "text": "我在一个大商场里买了一件衬衫。", "shortMeaning": "我在大商场买了一件衬衫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e63d0bf-7f09-4f8c-b842-512a1a2ced2f", "text": "我在一个小镇长大。", "shortMeaning": "我是在小镇上长大的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68712c2d-9f94-4b06-9617-e45aa707c1e3", "text": "我在一九七二年十月十日出生。", "shortMeaning": "我1972年10月10日出生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1defa35-04a7-406d-b0fe-e0f0026f3e9b", "text": "我在三点有个约会。", "shortMeaning": "我三点有个约会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b440d26e-c00f-44d5-a95a-d909187fbf20", "text": "我在上海虹桥路850弄22号1602室。", "shortMeaning": "我住在上海虹桥路850弄22号1602室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7f57a1b-5055-460e-af7c-98d813fe4045", "text": "我在下载这份网络档案。", "shortMeaning": "我在下载这份网络文件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9569c35b-d1d8-4c1b-af25-861fc5f9feeb", "text": "我在东京偶然遇到了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在东京碰巧遇到他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c0dbdf13-13d9-4415-9bb7-a8eff47038d0", "text": "我在东京出生长大。", "shortMeaning": "我在东京出生并长大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35a3f3e7-7a1b-45bf-a14b-f578ffdb1867", "text": "我在东京租不起这样的房子。", "shortMeaning": "这样的房子我在东京租不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0b9847f-5289-43d5-a139-4a09cdaa5273", "text": "我在两年前吃过一次。", "shortMeaning": "我两年前吃过一次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01509a6f-84c5-40e4-89dd-b21071735874", "text": "我在两点半左右到达神户。", "shortMeaning": "我两点半左右到达神户。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dc5a73f6-915e-4b2f-bfcc-1c6ac09b30db", "text": "我在中国不到一个月。", "shortMeaning": "我来中国还不到一个月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6c41c73-f1ac-4ee7-a469-5fc33aedabe4", "text": "我在中国最后的目的地是东北的哈尔滨，离北京大概一千公里左右。", "shortMeaning": "我在中国最后一站是哈尔滨，离北京约一千公里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f893092-c13c-40ab-a8f9-eeb0fb1772ba", "text": "我在乐队里担任键盘手。", "shortMeaning": "我在乐队担任键盘手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2912e9c0-2f2a-4e90-9cf9-107282854daa", "text": "我在二零一三年退休了。", "shortMeaning": "我2013年退休了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d743f28-92d6-4c50-b56e-9b19373f81b2", "text": "我在人群中和他走失了。", "shortMeaning": "我在人群里和他走散了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:febcf576-cb21-4d96-ba20-e42469be65c0", "text": "我在人群中找不到他。", "shortMeaning": "人群里我找不到他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65194f96-995e-47bc-b93c-fcc5ed075057", "text": "我在人群里走丢了。", "shortMeaning": "我在人群里迷了路。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dadf241b-4107-487d-a26a-c4fff61caa61", "text": "我在从家到学校的路上遇见了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在上学路上遇见了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d927e38d-d092-45de-8608-5eeef87ae164", "text": "我在以色列出生了。", "shortMeaning": "我出生在以色列。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b453f6a-d89d-4dbd-9750-1302c2154c2e", "text": "我在任何地方都没能找到。", "shortMeaning": "我在哪儿都没找到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5427f450-8d62-415d-9f88-e74b197e52d2", "text": "我在伦敦碰到了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在伦敦遇见了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1edfc81b-6342-4b5b-89df-63a6f992d98a", "text": "我在你的桌子抽屉里找到了这个。", "shortMeaning": "我在你桌子的抽屉里找到了这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48160fb5-374d-4a31-9a24-df6dbe6115f5", "text": "我在你的生日会送给你一辆自行车。", "shortMeaning": "你生日时我会送你一辆自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:943f6ecd-f1e5-4730-8550-f70b8c16be95", "text": "我在你这个年纪的时候，冥王星是一颗行星。", "shortMeaning": "我在你这个年纪时，冥王星还是行星。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75ab1e96-8a3c-42a5-9562-14d136d55a98", "text": "我在便利店买了肉包吃了。", "shortMeaning": "我在便利店买了肉包吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05b60c2b-6254-4831-a14f-3a1135c20f89", "text": "我在信封上写错了地址。", "shortMeaning": "我把信封上的地址写错了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27e6b795-b3ed-43f4-bb16-5bf5c44798ba", "text": "我在公交车上睡觉了。", "shortMeaning": "我在公交车上睡着了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b604ecf-6c83-4c4a-92e7-a0ca1ce4651a", "text": "我在削芹菜和土豆。", "shortMeaning": "我在削芹菜和马铃薯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57b694be-001c-49cc-a8da-8f87533be092", "text": "我在前一天遇到了他。", "shortMeaning": "我前一天遇到了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f88253cf-accb-4999-8fb3-2df68fe4f9da", "text": "我在剧场里坐在一个很高的人后面。", "shortMeaning": "我在剧场里坐在一个高个子后面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55ff5d8b-a6dc-47b6-9886-9f8b85d64e8a", "text": "我在加拿大住了五年。", "shortMeaning": "我在加拿大生活了五年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0258bec8-c900-47b1-b240-449a7a84b498", "text": "我在加拿大生活了近五年。", "shortMeaning": "我在加拿大住了近五年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd16a6c2-0968-4138-8487-144aeca7ab56", "text": "我在医院住了一个星期。", "shortMeaning": "我在医院住了一星期。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f975d69-c071-48e2-940f-b7185bcea5ce", "text": "我在叠我的连衣裙。", "shortMeaning": "我在叠连衣裙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67682b14-4f08-4106-bb71-fabff19a9b2b", "text": "我在吃一颗覆盆子。", "shortMeaning": "我在吃一粒覆盆子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e78c99e-a8c3-449b-8423-57cb9b877111", "text": "我在名古屋生活了1个多月。", "shortMeaning": "我在名古屋生活了一个多月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9755253f-2997-4dde-bae2-a6b909f20577", "text": "我在名古屋读的小学。", "shortMeaning": "我小学是在名古屋读的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e331d6f2-e1e7-4610-8ca1-b234f2a65c18", "text": "我在哪儿可以弄到电话卡？", "shortMeaning": "我在哪儿能买到电话卡？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78978778-5b01-4576-971e-8c2303214f33", "text": "我在哪儿都找不到她。", "shortMeaning": "我到处都找不到她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d53e2c5-761e-43b8-8c41-8ecaab26f52b", "text": "我在哪儿都没找到他。", "shortMeaning": "我到处都没找到他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e47b1ac-497d-4f9b-a299-faa8c4962b52", "text": "我在哪儿都没找到它。", "shortMeaning": "我到处都没找到它。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2a8df81-2ee3-4081-990b-3a2a322775d7", "text": "我在喝完盒装饮料后有把纸盒展开压平的习惯。", "shortMeaning": "我喝完整装饮料后习惯把纸盒展平。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2dd9e921-f21f-4dc7-b4d2-74dad9779861", "text": "我在回答之前必须考虑周全。", "shortMeaning": "回答前我必须考虑周全。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48243bfc-aad6-4289-8a4e-9b5c246aecc3", "text": "我在外地生活了很久。", "shortMeaning": "我在外地住了很久。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b11cb098-99a7-4f6b-bb07-5ad42a8ba780", "text": "我在家等你的消息。", "shortMeaning": "我在家等你的回音。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fe11e3f-aaf1-4afc-9da2-34a7f802fe69", "text": "我在居酒屋被一个奇怪的大叔找茬了。", "shortMeaning": "我在居酒屋被一个奇怪的大叔找茬。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51938746-ce43-42a0-a70c-3f9eed654b8d", "text": "我在工作，但是我妻子在家。", "shortMeaning": "我在上班，妻子在家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2de2cab3-be95-4d24-a0b1-c2396f9eee9b", "text": "我在巴黎待了三个月。", "shortMeaning": "我在巴黎逗留了三个月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c232d08d-81c8-443c-ba4a-c237fdadf3fe", "text": "我在巴黎碰见了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在巴黎遇见了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d2cb261-c36a-43c0-a26f-64bd532fcb35", "text": "我在市场营销部门。", "shortMeaning": "我在市场营销部工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2e76411-88ce-4928-809b-e2a98f4579bc", "text": "我在帮人在网上买东西。", "shortMeaning": "我在帮人网上购物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0ea55bb-04d4-4ac3-bfc8-5aa962d68257", "text": "我在年轻的时候抽烟。", "shortMeaning": "我年轻时抽烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49693d60-11e7-4b36-9383-9985d26b5e50", "text": "我在想哪个跑步运动员会跑第一。", "shortMeaning": "我在想谁会跑第一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac96c7b6-cab5-47c3-98fd-5900e27086a5", "text": "我在想能否在15分钟之内赶到联合车站。", "shortMeaning": "我在想能否十五分钟内赶到联合车站。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9074f546-05cc-41bd-ba02-9919c9b03a65", "text": "我在感受生命的气息。", "shortMeaning": "我在体味生命的气息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3268ee0b-d3cd-4bcd-bb98-266355399921", "text": "我在慢慢习惯这苛刻的气候。", "shortMeaning": "我在慢慢适应这严酷的气候。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccac444a-e84c-47a2-9696-fcd0b1319b97", "text": "我在我的院子里种了棵桃树。", "shortMeaning": "我在院子里种了棵桃树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a718850-9a42-4dd2-a08a-9e88c3950896", "text": "我在战争中失去了手臂。", "shortMeaning": "我在战争中失去了一只手臂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d770c508-eb19-4cd1-bb70-6f3e555efef5", "text": "我在打开包装时遇到了麻烦。", "shortMeaning": "我打开包装时遇到麻烦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3aef64b-9491-4608-90e0-a79f00f64ccc", "text": "我在找一份周末的零工。", "shortMeaning": "我在找一份周末零工。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dcfb1e48-429a-4e9f-b412-c5a430ce6dd9", "text": "我在找会说葡萄牙语的人。", "shortMeaning": "我在找会讲葡语的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c78191a-6949-4f49-9b77-75fdb74770f0", "text": "我在找关于古罗马历史的书。", "shortMeaning": "我在找关于古罗马史的书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:745cbb78-9624-4a55-815d-d4aac39e7f70", "text": "我在找我的眼镜呀。", "shortMeaning": "我在找我的眼镜呢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97dbad58-c524-4fbb-80c4-c11c149bab99", "text": "我在找有我尺寸的上衣。", "shortMeaning": "我在找合我尺寸的上衣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcdb7478-b693-4bb9-ac84-0b4145065cf0", "text": "我在报纸上刊登了我的房子的广告。", "shortMeaning": "我在报纸上登了房子的广告。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ea3d491c-afb1-4cf6-a0f6-a588324bd3d2", "text": "我在报纸上看到了它。", "shortMeaning": "我在报上看到它了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c156d8fc-6606-4ee4-934b-788a37caff98", "text": "我在推测他可能赢得比赛。", "shortMeaning": "我推测他可能赢得比赛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4fe10c6-0ef0-4ad4-a13d-d9429c5069f8", "text": "我在数学上很有天分。", "shortMeaning": "我在数学上很有天赋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a4cf3ba-7ae1-4c7a-82c0-de898bfadfc5", "text": "我在日历上作记号。", "shortMeaning": "我在日历上做记号。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a2b313f-29dd-4246-9105-74947bf8f803", "text": "我在日历上画图案。", "shortMeaning": "我在日历上画图。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2941e795-71c5-438d-b718-80279f61bb82", "text": "我在星期日不工作。", "shortMeaning": "我星期日不工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83f4e287-b96c-45dc-b1fc-7644a8b4e343", "text": "我在月色下放声歌唱。", "shortMeaning": "我在月光下放声唱歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21fed6db-4b28-45ff-9605-a824f0dec83c", "text": "我在树林里迷路了。", "shortMeaning": "我在树林里迷了路。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:874d725b-d1a3-4d26-84c5-5be992647f02", "text": "我在桌面上建了一个快捷方式。", "shortMeaning": "我在桌面建了快捷方式。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54260335-e563-46ce-9100-883b930056f9", "text": "我在检查这里有没有激光警报装置。", "shortMeaning": "我在检查这里有没有激光警报。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82cd69ef-6c05-49ef-bfb1-e454b02f0f3f", "text": "我在欧洲偶遇了姑母。", "shortMeaning": "我在欧洲巧遇姑母。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13da9113-b2ce-497a-af69-50ea45672728", "text": "我在水族馆里看到了一只巨大的章鱼。", "shortMeaning": "我在水族馆看到一只大章鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dca15324-8219-4345-ac88-cdb374639496", "text": "我在法国南边的一座小山买了一所房子，准备在那里建设老人院。", "shortMeaning": "我在法国南部小山买了房，准备建老人院。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92392b95-20b1-47cb-b35b-9c49bae7b1de", "text": "我在法国认识到他们了。", "shortMeaning": "我是在法国认识他们的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c65de8e-d16b-4f48-8ed0-44940f1ddd03", "text": "我在波士顿住了三年。", "shortMeaning": "我在波士顿生活了三年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4165f35-a651-4949-9691-66e8cb889c0a", "text": "我在洗澡的时候，电话响了。", "shortMeaning": "我洗澡时电话响了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9165689-0bda-47dd-9e85-08fb4f381620", "text": "我在海上已经生活了好几个月。", "shortMeaning": "我在海上生活了好几个月。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41b75a6d-85a3-43ef-83c3-887a632b98fc", "text": "我在海滩上发现了一个漂亮的贝壳。", "shortMeaning": "我在海滩发现一个漂亮贝壳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1ea530b-7d4e-4849-afb4-8469b11bcada", "text": "我在海边捡了个漂亮贝壳。", "shortMeaning": "我在海边捡到一个漂亮贝壳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff392ee5-b370-4aae-acb2-0afdf7acd075", "text": "我在涩谷站遇到了吉行先生。", "shortMeaning": "我在涩谷站遇见吉行先生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2894754-52c6-4ce2-82e7-ea1471d66ab4", "text": "我在火车上待了12小时。", "shortMeaning": "我在火车上待了十二小时。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0432b635-aef7-4d26-8496-d2438c53c628", "text": "我在火车上碰到老朋友。", "shortMeaning": "我在火车上遇见老朋友。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b207dad-ded3-46b2-b4a1-337964aaf1fb", "text": "我在牙医那儿检查了牙齿。", "shortMeaning": "我在牙医那里查了牙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:897b5552-3978-4eb7-85ca-9b720a584def", "text": "我在班里是最高的。", "shortMeaning": "我是班里最高的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8652f358-3fb2-4b58-909b-8ed6e1db83ff", "text": "我在理发店碰到了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在理发店遇见了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f29da1f1-bdfb-44b6-9bd7-953b667b603f", "text": "我在电梯里面闻到烟味。", "shortMeaning": "我在电梯里闻到烟味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8145988-9abe-40b5-a245-9b12b8f46d10", "text": "我在电视上看到过他，不过没有看到过他本人。", "shortMeaning": "我在电视上见过他，但没见过他本人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5195a936-824a-467d-9ca5-412acafb2b44", "text": "我在电视上看到过她。", "shortMeaning": "我在电视上见过她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b8501f8-d56c-41ff-8cfe-290460644169", "text": "我在看南京到上海的动车，第一趟太早了，第三趟有点晚。", "shortMeaning": "我看南京到上海的动车，第一趟太早、第三趟有点晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74738837-1a44-4b18-a8f7-d83f6184cfef", "text": "我在站台尽头遇到了他。", "shortMeaning": "我在站台尽头遇见他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31929128-2160-42ab-81b0-4879ec13e5c4", "text": "我在第四十大街下了车。", "shortMeaning": "我在第四十街下车了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f49c866-4684-4ae3-a753-82d66af0ed41", "text": "我在等你们。你们什么时候准备好？", "shortMeaning": "我在等你们，你们什么时候准备好？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31e67ad0-4626-480f-bc9a-39b866177b07", "text": "我在等待着某个人。", "shortMeaning": "我在等待某个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb895a55-c10e-4739-bf79-67ae3ad2781b", "text": "我在给魔鬼当辩护士。", "shortMeaning": "我在替魔鬼辩护。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47503544-a66d-4aba-9ec6-258e4da9643c", "text": "我在考虑明年去国外。", "shortMeaning": "我在考虑明年出国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79add279-e0be-4ea6-9e08-9bdf1c4cdf9e", "text": "我在聚会上见了史密斯。", "shortMeaning": "我在聚会上见到史密斯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:676ba129-8cf7-4da4-9c90-1eafa078ee92", "text": "我在花园种了番茄和洋葱。", "shortMeaning": "我在花园里种了番茄和洋葱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:894bb24d-848b-41ca-973e-33ccff15f2f7", "text": "我在草地上直躺下来了。", "shortMeaning": "我直接躺在了草地上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a99aeab-f3db-4c8d-a63d-a66fb1badcc4", "text": "我在街上碰到了弗雷德。", "shortMeaning": "我在街上遇见弗雷德。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e70438a-983c-4e8e-9b8e-836c76bfbbe6", "text": "我在西班牙买的这个。", "shortMeaning": "这个是我在西班牙买的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:754e9fb3-a3c3-4d2c-88e0-0317235209ce", "text": "我在这东西上花了十美元。", "shortMeaning": "我为这东西花了十美元。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3722ea6a-a39a-4d23-b636-f0586ea4dfa8", "text": "我在这个世界散发着自己的光芒。", "shortMeaning": "我在这个世界散发着光芒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5061f5d5-f343-4281-8e7d-86dca243b7c6", "text": "我在这个城市里没有人认识。", "shortMeaning": "这个城市里没人认识我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d937ce0-887a-4acd-a53b-af746aab386e", "text": "我在这个网站上能找到什么？", "shortMeaning": "这网站上我能找到什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ae7e306-4f04-408d-8d56-6cfb6b8267a6", "text": "我在这些论坛上没有帐号。", "shortMeaning": "我在这些论坛上没有账号。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7f52374-a508-47a8-87bd-e894de009038", "text": "我在这座小镇感到很孤独。", "shortMeaning": "我在这座小镇感到孤独。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f6d153b-81ce-43e6-8b2c-bf4fa106295d", "text": "我在这张地图上的哪里？", "shortMeaning": "我在这张地图的哪个位置？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:369181ce-a6b6-44fe-b0f5-c4171225ead5", "text": "我在这里总感到约束。", "shortMeaning": "我在这里总感到拘束。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b3294ff-b99b-41e9-b966-8d5acf3a53ad", "text": "我在这里能跳舞吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能在这里跳舞吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a654375c-c573-412b-99c4-ad54df50b0c7", "text": "我在这里见到了她。", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿见到了她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae50b1ac-9b09-4906-a5ad-a72987a435e8", "text": "我在这项计划上投入了所有精力。", "shortMeaning": "我在这项计划上倾注了全部精力。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec97a574-3cf7-4e06-8a4e-87090882550a", "text": "我在这，你想聊天吗？", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿，你想聊天吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f33ba426-b75c-4036-9c0e-e18a5f918c9b", "text": "我在那边坐着，假装我没在听。", "shortMeaning": "我坐在那边，假装没在听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79bf5fe6-85a7-4722-8717-8c33bc2d3168", "text": "我在酒铺买了一瓶啤酒。", "shortMeaning": "我在酒店买了一瓶啤酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b898299-6e8d-4909-a186-13ceb6563ccf", "text": "我在银行存了1000美金。", "shortMeaning": "我在银行存了一千美金。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e646811-9d58-4e76-a21f-7bbfc9c14985", "text": "我在闲暇时候写诗。", "shortMeaning": "我闲暇时写诗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc861f51-50dd-4cd8-96e2-5f3e70ce0633", "text": "我在阅读中度过了一天中最美好的部分。", "shortMeaning": "我一天中最美好的时光在阅读中度过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65065c50-e823-4981-8f73-154373b2127d", "text": "我在阅读他的报告。", "shortMeaning": "我在读他的报告。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a437dab-b036-4d63-9f95-129947e5400e", "text": "我在马来西亚居住。", "shortMeaning": "我住在马来西亚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36a42965-e585-4a8a-bbac-c8850d7dac51", "text": "我在骑自行车溜达。", "shortMeaning": "我骑自行车溜达。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
